{"id":2746,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>3月18日下午，马克思主义学院在4号楼211会议室召开2025-2026学年第二学期马克思主义学院学生干部会议。学院党委副书记李庆乐与院团学办负责人刘莉莉老师出席本次会议，我院研究生会全体成员参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Lnm9MYL7UsMlLZnozQ2LlCbMN78nzGuiU4LDUml4nm6fnm70gihFp2hmCIa0okyPU1hkU1y4olUYU49inRlPMmUPozvinmLbMzW2UllYLzWFL4A7ozGsMRQFL4NZL7UJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/81BBB39D2C85D51641975F3952FAE212/38D90746/3980D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 557px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUmlMPUmTRMzA2UozTVoRvsU8nRL8Qu7L4CYUlLsn7lsnlL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyankh7nSyPnNUPM4VVLzGsUzNDLz9PU4CPL4V7nRU4M7QFLRWkLRvYMlnFLmN8Ul7PgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMzGigtA8pUUcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUm6MkLR62M7-aMomvYM4fVLlr2n77ubMR9bnRrfUmNbLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRUSybLYh7MmliMmLZolliUl78nzUbolrfMllDU49iU4VFMR6RnzW2M4MFM4M7n1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9CA93D6556389E5AA4E499EA5E6C85C1/47CE2F73/73DF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUm6MkLR62M7-aMomvYM4fVLlr2n77ubMR9bnRrfUmNbLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRUSybLYh7MmliMmLZolliUl78nzUbolrfMllDU49iU4VFMR6RnzW2M4MFM4M7n1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>会上，研究生会各部门负责人及主席团成员依次汇报工作计划与发展展望，明确各板块工作思路与推进举措。随后，李书记对上学期研究生会成员的工作表示充分肯定，并对全体学生干部提出四点要求：一是保持昂扬斗志，筑牢思想根基；二是重视后备干部培养，完善梯队建设；三是合理统筹学习与工作时间，做到两不误、双促进；四是主动沟通反馈，及时向老师反映工作困难与同学诉求。最后，刘老师结合学院工作实际，对新学期重点任务作出细致部署，并针对各部门职责提出具体、可落地的要求。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM8CMZUzl8ozQknom9PoR7bL8LsUlUuiMmL4MR6kLRWkLl70gihFp2hmCIa0nSyioSyan1yiLzWRMmLZnNlan7Mfoz9bLz6RMlUiL4WRoRfFUzQ7nR9PMmMFM8L4n1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E590F512C638FE0DCA98917C5D532C80/A6DD8163/7C3F\" vheight=\" 354.879px\" vwidth=\" 515px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM8CMZUzl8ozQknom9PoR7bL8LsUlUuiMmL4MR6kLRWkLl70gihFp2hmCIa0nSyioSyan1yiLzWRMmLZnNlan7Mfoz9bLz6RMlUiL4WRoRfFUzQ7nR9PMmMFM8L4n1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次会议主题鲜明、部署详实，进一步厘清了新学期学生工作的思路与方向，明确了各项任务目标与工作要求，为学院新学期学生工作平稳有序开展、学生干部队伍能力提升提供了有力保障。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LLmUM4MmLZMmNPnomLbMlWfnlMfLzVukMzvbLRr7oR9PUz70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaLYyaLYh2Um78nzLYn7UYMRN4UzNiMl7PU4nfL7CsUmWFnmNinlCYLmAFUNrkL1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/30303FB14E32DD2493A955A1C4A0F7B2/F95EF228/BEB2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 510px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LLmUM4MmLZMmNPnomLbMlWfnlMfLzVukMzvbLRr7oR9PUz70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaLYyaLYh2Um78nzLYn7UYMRN4UzNiMl7PU4nfL7CsUmWFnmNinlCYLmAFUNrkL1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Lnm9MYL7UsMlLZnozQ2LlCbMN78nzGuiU4LDUml4nm6fnm70gihFp2hmCIa0okyPU1hkU1y4olUYU49inRlPMmUPozvinmLbMzW2UllYLzWFL4A7ozGsMRQFL4NZL7UJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CiLRlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6505&e=.jpg"}